{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7e30d3b3-8521-878e-9800-226868425159",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T15:11:18-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ivone Varela",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T15:08:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T15:09:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi? Um, is this, uh, the cab company? Like Newport taxi?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T15:09:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, ma'am, this is the City Clerk's office at Newport City Hall. I think you may have the wrong number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T15:09:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh? Really? I dialed the number off a magnet on my fridge? It starts with four-oh-one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T15:09:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Four-oh-one is the right area code for Rhode Island, so that part is fine. It may be that one of the digits after it is off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T15:09:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait, so the area code is the same for everybody? I thought maybe there was a different one for, like, Newport? Versus Providence?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T15:09:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, the whole state shares four-oh-one. So Newport and Providence are the same. It's the seven digits after that which tell the number apart."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T15:09:48-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay? So I just have a digit wrong? I'm on speakerphone, sorry, my hands are full? [pause] My tenant's car is, um, stuck, and her car got messed up in the storm Friday and Saturday? So she needs a ride to the shop?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T15:10:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry to hear that. I'd suggest looking at the magnet again, or searching online for a taxi company in Newport. I can't give out a number for a particular company from here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T15:10:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay? Could, um, could you transfer me to the, what is it, the cab office? Is there a city one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T15:10:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There isn't a city taxi office, no. Taxi companies are private businesses. The city does license them in some way, but I wouldn't be the one to dispatch a car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T15:10:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. So you're not, um, the Licensing Department? You said Clerk's? I thought you said, like, Clerk's... Clark's? Is that a different office?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T15:10:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's Clerk, C-L-E-R-K. The City Clerk's office. We handle records, licenses, and things like that. It's one office, and it's not a taxi service."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T15:10:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay? So Clerk, not Clark? Sorry, I'm a little mixed up today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T15:10:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right, it happens a lot. If the magnet has the number printed, read it slowly and dial it again. Or you can look it up on your phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T15:11:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I'll try that? I'll look at the magnet again? Thank you for being so nice about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T15:11:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble at all. I hope your tenant gets her car sorted out. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T15:11:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks? Bye?"
    }
  ],
